ght AfD is calling for a normalization of relations.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Ukraine steps up measures to protect railways</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e91b668e3f61de742597ceac77f838e8b12082b67688c7dfef5a009743926095</id><updated>2026-09-19T18:40:33Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T15:37:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ukraine-steps-up-measures-to-protect-railways/a-79339087--356ca60a409d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-steps-up-measures-to-protect-railways/a-79339087?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As Russia increases its attacks on Ukraine's rail infrastructure, the Ukrainian government has called for help to replace destroyed locomotives and is making plans to keep passengers safe.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>CNN, MS NOW and Politico denied access to White House</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5cdd829e6ea53ef533ea0755ee53a306a77c984e6130b6f6ce69e28de21eaba6</id><updated>2026-09-19T18:40:36Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T15:33:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/cnn-ms-now-and-politico-denied-access-to-white-house/a-79339055--e53ebc96fb07.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/cnn-ms-now-and-politico-denied-access-to-white-house/a-79339055?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Three US news outlets said their journalists were blocked from entering the White House grounds, hours after President Donald Trump announced bans on several media outlets.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Mecklenburg-Western Pomerania: Will economy shape the vote?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3f56a8512b45a19ff0ce59a43b683ba3ae728e7fc50b92d78f0ed0876127d554</id><updated>2026-09-19T18:40:38Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T14:51:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/mecklenburg-western-pomera