 term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Thousands protest Kennedy Center demolition fears</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cb5f0ed24b787f65a77d76195b865da9ea36092c9e634df8eedde4012403cf4e</id><updated>2026-09-19T18:39:29Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T11:09:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/thousands-protest-kennedy-center-demolition-fears/a-79337558--909372d8f6c9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/thousands-protest-kennedy-center-demolition-fears/a-79337558?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Protesters took part in a "Hands Around the Kennedy Center" human chain. The demonstration comes amid fears the Trump administration could tear the arts hub down.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Oktoberfest 2026: Everything you need to know</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5ce095f539cd15826a605d757bd6d8e32eb9fe7b9506376921ccb5b46478bb81</id><updated>2026-09-19T18:39:29Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T09:40:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/oktoberfest-2026-everything-you-need-to-know/a-79311285--1e3ee9d16248.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/oktoberfest-2026-everything-you-need-to-know/a-79311285?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">This year, AI will be used to manage overcrowded situations. Find all the numbers surrounding the fest — including the price of water!</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Rebels, workers, radicals: The making of 'Red Berlin'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:80c178606c718eb53086368c995f278dc8e5d54257ab19b3c0322873d413b906</id><updated>2026-09-19T18:39:29Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T09:14:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/rebels-workers-radicals-the-making-of-red-berlin/a-79325410--afcfe0d2ce3c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/rebels-workers-radicals-the-making-of